    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizdoc-List Ecommerce Cart Summarys-v3-spec",
    "description": "The Retrieve Ecommerce Cart Summary API allows consumers to access a detailed summary of items currently in a user's shopping cart. It provides essential insights into the cart, including the total number of items, pricing, and any applicable discounts or promotions. This endpoint is particularly useful for ecommerce platforms, shopping applications, and customer service representatives who need to manage or review a user's cart effectively. Developers integrating shopping experiences will find this API instrumental in enhancing user engagement and streamlining checkout processes.",
